////////////////////////////////
//~ rjf: ARM64 (AArch64) Register Table
//
// NOTE: `fp` and `lr` are the primary names for x29 and x30; `x29`/`x30` are
// aliases, as are the 32-bit `w` views, and the q/d/s/h/b views of the `v`
// vector registers. The DWARF and RDI register numberings are attached to the
// primary registers only.

@table(name  base  off  size  is_vector  has_rdi  has_dwarf)
ARM64_RegTable:
{
  {nil            -        0    0    - x -}
  {x0             -        0    8    - x x}
